{"id":"c55ea286e3a348e0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-existential-contraction.md","title":"c.e. 关系投影与有限存在块收缩","display":"thm-existential-contraction — c.e. 关系投影与有限存在块收缩","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-existential-contraction","aliases":["20-thm-existential-contraction"],"display":"thm-existential-contraction — c.e. 关系投影与有限存在块收缩","chapter":"2","section":"2.1.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.5；Corollary 2.1.6","source_printed_pages":[24],"source_pdf_pages":[60],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-thm-re-proj]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-existential-contraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-existential-contraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-existential-contraction — c.e. 关系投影与有限存在块收缩"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.5；Corollary 2.1.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>24</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^{n+1}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^{n+1}\\)</span> 为可计算关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(E\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span> 的配对码为 c.e.。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_R:=\\{x:\\exists y_1\\cdots\\exists y_n\\ R(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n)\\}\">\\(A_R:=\\{x:\\exists y_1\\cdots\\exists y_n\\ R(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_E:=\\{x:\\exists y\\ E(x,y)\\}\">\\(P_E:=\\{x:\\exists y\\ E(x,y)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时存在块为空。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}existential-contraction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists S\\subseteq\\omega^2\\ [\\chi_S\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in A_R\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists z\\ S(x,z))],\\\\\nA_R\\in\\mathcal E,\\qquad P_E\\in\\mathcal E.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}existential-contraction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists S\\subseteq\\omega^2\\ [\\chi_S\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in A_R\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists z\\ S(x,z))],\\\\\nA_R\\in\\mathcal E,\\qquad P_E\\in\\mathcal E.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 时固定长度的自然数元组可经反复配对编码，解码各坐标均全可计算且每个元组都有码。置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x,z)=R(x,\\pi_1^{(n)}(z),\\ldots,\\pi_n^{(n)}(z))\">\\(S(x,z)=R(x,\\pi_1^{(n)}(z),\\ldots,\\pi_n^{(n)}(z))\\)</span>，两个存在式显然等价。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x,z)=R(x)\">\\(S(x,z)=R(x)\\)</span>，用任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 作无作用见证，仍成立。正规形定理于是给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_R\">\\(A_R\\)</span> c.e.。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> c.e.，正规形给可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(x,y)\\iff\\exists t\\ Q(x,y,t)\">\\(E(x,y)\\iff\\exists t\\ Q(x,y,t)\\)</span>；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,t)\">\\((y,t)\\)</span> 配对得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_E\">\\(P_E\\)</span> 的一个存在量词正规形，因此投影 c.e.。过程统一于已经给定的关系程序及固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>；元组码只要求同一固定有效编码，不要求沿用原书示例的质数幂编码。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 24 / PDF 60。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-proj","status":"resolved","id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-proj]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-proj","status":"resolved","id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"A_R:=\\{x:\\exists y_1\\cdots\\exists y_n\\ R(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_E:=\\{x:\\exists y\\ E(x,y)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}existential-contraction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists S\\subseteq\\omega^2\\ [\\chi_S\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in A_R\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists z\\ S(x,z))],\\\\\nA_R\\in\\mathcal E,\\qquad P_E\\in\\mathcal E.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"S(x,z)=R(x,\\pi_1^{(n)}(z),\\ldots,\\pi_n^{(n)}(z))","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"S(x,z)=R(x)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"A_R","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"E(x,y)\\iff\\exists t\\ Q(x,y,t)","display":false},{"tex":"(y,t)","display":false},{"tex":"P_E","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1987,"backlinks":[{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-existential-contraction]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-existential-contraction]] — 章 2；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-existential-contraction]]"}],"outgoing":["35073b74f84433b3","60af447f5d59a8dc","e343870c773cb68e","17d2f06d43a19f1e"]}